            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJaEJbMCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAFX+0o0xO+dhlLq0bxIVBeT4\nd69lfriLem3CvJOvfAZF6DduBohnBKrr/jdyZif6NTRZ/KRAlX0QrCxUkLp11btu\nPOl0KZH40/IMYdJV2xTW8BFO1idC1/ykHjeXVXVIlQCHVOV8Z7aekoBPyWfk1DfH\n20qeIYtnS5pQK21lbQSjCWwHdnoTHCyEJWxF1PQv0Pwi3NZfjBaj+XkjJ/YfhOKE\n5GkfV/EfQeRZ+8S0yYi/dazUmGdPqZk9jVC8aIJeEAZjCpOdbJAjj1OAv/cP5jNL\n0+DD1aB3pMxoI94S6ynYUmu/IGMjFXrcSQb3bfk9NnTa+REqLtMwKNp28JrODAw=\n=6/j9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 445b17972de54e1b5233f7c0b74472308665571d\nparent 107f2424bb4076b054773048a658e1e2ae76e92d\nauthor Steve Cohen <scohen@scohen.org> 1511036620 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1511036620 -0800\n\nChanged where hackney compiles its metrics module (#2)\n\nUnder erlang 20, compilation is slower, and compiling the metrics\r\nmodule when a connection is created doesn't make sense, as this can\r\ncause the whole code server to become buried under recompilation\r\nrequests. This moves compilation to the application's start."
